- `actor(a_default, "Default", [...])`: The actor is incorrectly defined as "Default"; the source text explicitly identifies the actor as the "review clerk".
- `action(n1, "start the process")`: Hallucinated action; the source text states the clerk should "start by reviewing the received application", making the review the actual first step, not a separate "start" action.
- `action(n12, "End")`: Hallucinated action; the source text states "the process will come to an end", which should merely be represented by the `end(e1)` node rather than an executable action step.